> > If it’s a core business function — do it yourself, no matter what.
>
> [Joel Spolsky]($text.attrs('author')) [In Defense of Not-Invented-Here Syndrome](https://www.joelonsoftware.com/2001/10/14/in-defense-of-not-invented-here-syndrome/#:~:text=If%20it%E2%80%99s%20a%20core%20business%20function%20%E2%80%94%20do%20it%20yourself%2C%20no%20matter%20what)
